### Serverless & Async Queue Webhook Demo Requests
### Base URLs
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@infraUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/infra
@internalBypassSecret = boilerplate-internal-bypass-secret
@qstashSignature = your_upstash_jwt_signature_here

### ==================================================================
### 1. Process Task via Local Internal Bypass (POST)
### ==================================================================

### 1.1 Process Task (Global / Non-tenant)
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue/process-task
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-webhook-bypass: {{internalBypassSecret}}

{
    "action": "App\\Jobs\\SampleReportJob",
    "payload": {
        "report_type": "monthly_summary",
        "format": "pdf"
    }
}

### 1.2 Process Task within Multi-Tenant Schema Isolation
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue/process-task
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-webhook-bypass: {{internalBypassSecret}}

{
    "action": "App\\Jobs\\TenantExportJob",
    "tenant_id": "tenant_paying",
    "payload": {
        "export_id": "exp_98765",
        "entity": "transactions"
    }
}

### ==================================================================
### 2. Process Task via Upstash QStash Signature (POST)
### ==================================================================

### 2.1 Process Task with Upstash Signature Header
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue/process-task
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Upstash-Signature: {{qstashSignature}}

{
    "action": "App\\Jobs\\ProcessSubscriptionJob",
    "tenant_id": "tenant_demo",
    "payload": {
        "cycle": "2026-09"
    }
}

### ==================================================================
### 3. Sad Paths & Security Validation (HTTP 401 & 422)
### ==================================================================

### 3.1 Sad Path: Missing Authentication/Signature (Expects 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue/process-task
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "action": "App\\Jobs\\SampleJob",
    "payload": {}
}

### 3.2 Sad Path: Invalid Bypass Secret (Expects 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue/process-task
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-webhook-bypass: wrong-secret-token

{
    "action": "App\\Jobs\\SampleJob",
    "payload": {}
}

### 3.3 Sad Path: Missing Action Parameter (Expects 422 Unprocessable)
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue/process-task
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-webhook-bypass: {{internalBypassSecret}}

{
    "payload": {}
}

### 3.4 Sad Path: Non-existent Tenant ID (Expects 404 Not Found)
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue/process-task
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-webhook-bypass: {{internalBypassSecret}}

{
    "action": "App\\Jobs\\SampleJob",
    "tenant_id": "tenant_non_existent",
    "payload": {}
}
